韓、魏，遇奪釜鬲於涂。聞應侯任鄭安平、王稽皆負重罪於秦，應侯內慚，蔡澤乃西入秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蔡澤","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"李兌","kind":"person","person_id":"g2v_d8d_els","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"聖人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"蔡澤","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"djm_aky_j4f","status":"contextual_provis